        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>§4.3 体内物质的运输 - 笔记</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f5f2ea;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 700px;\n    background-color: #fbfaf4;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0px,\n      transparent 27px,\n      #b9d3e6 28px\n    );\n    background-position: 0 40px;\n    padding: 50px 45px 60px 45px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    position: relative;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"楷体\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    color: #26489c;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n  }\n  .header-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 30px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #9aa5c0;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .brace-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 2px 0 6px 30px;\n  }\n  .brace-block .brace {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n  }\n  .brace-block .items span {\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .sub-brace {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sub-brace .brace-small {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    margin: 0 4px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n  .indent1 { margin-left: 20px; }\n  .indent2 { margin-left: 45px; }\n  .indent3 { margin-left: 65px; }\n  .indent4 { margin-left: 85px; }\n  .arrow-note {\n    color: #26489c;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .section-line {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .unclear {\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  hr.thin {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #26489c;\n    width: 140px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 20px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #888;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"header-note\">[illegible header text]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"title\">§ 4.3 体内物质的运输</div>\n\n  <div class=\"brace-block\">\n    <span>血液循环系统</span>\n    <span class=\"brace\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"items\">\n      <span>血液</span>\n      <span>心脏</span>\n      <span>血管</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line indent1\">一. 血液(约为体重的7% ~ 8%)</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"section-line indent1\">1. 血液\n    <span class=\"sub-brace\" style=\"display:inline-flex;vertical-align:middle;\">\n      <span class=\"brace-small\">{</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">血浆(55%)\n    <span class=\"sub-brace\">\n      <span class=\"brace-small\">{</span>\n      <span>水、无机盐、葡萄糖、蛋白质<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span>等</span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"arrow-note\">运载血细胞，运输养料和废物</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">血细胞(45%)\n    <span class=\"sub-brace\">\n      <span class=\"brace-small\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"items\">\n        <span>红细胞</span>\n        <span>白细胞</span>\n        <span>血小板</span>\n      </span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <br>\n  <div class=\"indent1\">— 一次失血超过体内血量的30%，就会危及生命</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">2. 红细胞</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(1)特点：没有细胞核，呈两面凹的圆盘状\n    <span class=\"arrow-note\">增加表面积，携氧量</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(2)数量：正常男性平均为500万个/mm³</div>\n  <div class=\"indent3\">正常女性平均为420万个/mm³</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(3)功能：运输氧和部分二氧化碳</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(4)红细胞的特性：在氧浓度高的地方容易与氧结合，在氧浓度低的地方容易与氧分离</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">3. 白细胞</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(1)特点：数量少，有细胞核，体积比红细胞大</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(2)数量：一般在4000~10000个/mm³血液范围内波动</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(3)功能：吞噬侵入人体内的细菌，保护人体免受感染</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(4)功能<span class=\"unclear\">???</span>：本体防御和保护和病菌<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span>，主要能做变形运动过血管壁，并有免疫作用</div>\n  <div class=\"indent3\">(数量少[每红细胞数量约为1:600]但种类多)</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">4. 血小板</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(1)特点：形状不规则，无细胞核，很小</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(2)直径2~4μm，体积仅次于红细胞1<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span>，是血液中最小的有形成分</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(3)数量：正常成人为15~30万个/mm³</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">(4)功能：加速血液凝固，防止大量出血及阻止细菌入侵</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">5. 人体血细胞数量变化及症状</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">红细胞　　若数目减少，就是贫血</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">白细胞　　若数目增多，就是身体有炎症</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">血小板　　若数目减少，不能凝血</div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">6. 血细胞的寿命</div>\n  <div class=\"indent2\">血细胞都有一定的寿命，红细胞有寿命约为120天，大约60天后红细胞更换一半，红骨髓具有造血<span class=\"unclear\">[illegible]</span></div>\n  <br>\n\n  <div class=\"indent1\">7. 血液的功能</div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:120px;height:60px;position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:20px;opacity:0.5;\">[Finger/shadow artifact: bottom-left]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
